# Secrets and credentials — NEVER commit.
#
# This directory holds the cookie-signing secret, the admin password, the
# database connection string and the Portal integration secret. It also holds
# team-codes.csv, which db/seed.js writes with every team's PLAINTEXT password.
# Any one of those in a repository is a full compromise of the level.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
team-codes.csv
*.csv

# Build output and dependencies
.next/
node_modules/
out/
build/

# Logs and OS noise
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.DS_Store
